# Not authoritative for anything: the frontend locks via pnpm-lock.yaml, and
# Supabase Edge Functions resolve per-function from supabase/functions/*/deno.json
# (see config.toml `import_map` entries) with no committed root lockfile needed.
# A root deno.lock only reappears here as a side effect of running `deno` CLI
# commands (check/lint/cache) from the repo root or above supabase/functions/,
# since Deno's lockfile discovery walks up looking for one to reuse.
deno.lock
